---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy — Fabio Steyer"
  description="Privacy information."
  altHref="/datenschutz"
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>

  <div class="beleg-fehlt mt-6">
    <strong>DRAFT, NOT REVIEWED BY A LAWYER.</strong> This text describes the technical state of
    the site and names the legal bases it relies on. No legal professional has reviewed it.
    The controller details are still open (see below).
  </div>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="controller">
    <h2 id="controller" class="doc-section__label">Controller</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        Controller within the meaning of Art. 4(7) GDPR for the processing of personal data
        when this site is accessed:
      </p>
      <div class="beleg-fehlt mt-4">
        <strong>DECISION PENDING.</strong> The name and contact details of the controller
        under Art. 13(1)(a) GDPR have not been settled. The decision is tied to the question
        of whether and to what extent a postal address is published
        (see <a href="/en/legal-notice">Legal notice</a>).
        This page must not be published while this notice is here.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="technical">
    <h2 id="technical" class="doc-section__label">Technical state of this site</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Fully static site. No backend, no database, no contact form.</li>
        <li>No cookies, no tracking, no analytics, no social media embeds.</li>
        <li>No external fonts. System fonts only.</li>
        <li>No third-party scripts or stylesheets.</li>
        <li>No client-side JavaScript.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="hosting">
    <h2 id="hosting" class="doc-section__label">Hosting</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        The site is served by GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. St.,
        San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. For users in the European Economic Area GitHub names
        GitHub B.V., Prins Bernhardplein 200, 1097 JB Amsterdam, Netherlands.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
        On each request the provider processes technically necessary connection data, including
        the IP address, the date and time of the request and the resource requested. I have no
        influence over the scope or retention of that processing. The legal basis is
        Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR; the legitimate interest is the technically reliable delivery of the site.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed mt-4">
        Details on the provider's processing:
        <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub General Privacy Statement</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="rights">
    <h2 id="rights" class="doc-section__label">Data subject rights</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 leading-relaxed">
        <li>Access to the personal data processed (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Erasure (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
        <li>Objection to processing based on Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" aria-labelledby="complaint">
    <h2 id="complaint" class="doc-section__label">Right to lodge a complaint</h2>
    <div class="doc-section__body">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        There is also a right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (Art. 77 GDPR).
        The competent authority at the controller's place of residence is the Berliner Beauftragte
        für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit, Alt-Moabit 59–61, 10555 Berlin, Germany.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-muted)">
        The German version of this page is authoritative.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
